      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh. Traps are moves that spread obstacles around\nthe battlefield—fire, rocks, things like that.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
